      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Founded in 1933 by Greek immigrant Mike Hatzis, the Columbine Café remains family‑owned and a historic roadside stop.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
