      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Pleasant_View%2C_Colorado",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1904 the Denver and Intermountain Railroad began rail service to Pleasant View, sparking the town’s early subdivision boom.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Pleasant_View%2C_Colorado",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Residential development kicked off in 1908 when D.J. and Cecelia Prentiss built Pleasant View’s first house.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
