      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Pleasant_View%2C_Colorado",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Pleasant View’s name traces back to 1860 when George Pullman and partners founded the Cold Spring Ranch during the Colorado Gold Rush.",
